{
  "version": 2,
  "engine": "drone",
  "name": "drone_storm_gr34",
  "description": "Storm on the GR34: wind and rain on the bare heath above the sea. E Phrygian on a deep root and fifth, an F grinding against them; gusts of wind (the air layer) and light come and go on slow random walks, the sparkles fall like rain, and everything keeps moving, cold and raw.",
  "drone": {
